        "Description": "Good evening 47.\rWe have been tasked with the elimination of an individual known as Farah.\rAccording to our intel, Farah is the friend and confidant of Sinhi Venthan, a pirate queen. Being very distrustful towards Noel Crest after entering an agreement, Farah has started investigating.\rThe client, Noel Crest, wants to have her silenced, even if that means by extreme measures.\rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47, I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
